  "description": "Reid Blacktop 2 ST 350W | Commuter eBike\nMid-drive power. Everyday comfort.\nThe Reid Blacktop 2 ST 350W is a step-through electric bike designed for commuting, everyday journeys and leisure rides. Its lightweight alloy frame makes getting on and off easier, while the 27.5-inch wheels with Kenda 27.5 x 2.1-inch tyres provide stability and grip across a variety of riding surfaces.\nPowered by a 350W, 48V mid-drive motor, the Blacktop 2 ST delivers responsive assistance with speeds of up to 32km/h. The 13.4Ah battery, with a capacity of 643Wh, provides power for longer journeys, while the onboard display shows key riding information to help monitor performance.\nA Shimano 9-speed drivetrain offers a versatile range of gears for different routes and gradients. Tektro hydraulic disc brakes provide reliable stopping power, with a 180mm rotors for controlled braking in varied conditions.\nComfort and practicality are built into the design, with a City Sport addle, ergonomic grips and an adjustable stem to help tailor the riding position. A rear-mounted alloy rack provides space for bags and everyday essentials, while integrated lighting and reflectors help improve visibility in low-light conditions.\nThe Reid Blacktop 2 ST 350W is ideal for:\n\nEasy access – Step-through frame for convenient mounting and dismounting\n\nEveryday commuting – Mid-drive electric assistance for regular journeys\n\nSpeeds up to 32km/h – Electric assistance for efficient everyday trave\n\nLonger rides – 643Wh stated battery capacity for extended riding\n\nVersatile gearing – Shimano 9-speed drivetrain for varied routes and gradients\n\nReliable braking – Tektro hydraulic disc brakes with 180mm rotors\n\nComfort-focused riding – City Sport saddle, ergonomic grips and adjustable stem\n\nPractical carrying – Rear-mounted alloy rack for bags and daily essentials\n\nLow-light visibility – Integrated lighting and reflectors\n\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
